rec(621,1976,[19,10,9,11,9,9,7,5,3,2],0,0,'Conway develops a connected argument from games to number systems with playful explanatory transitions. It is original mathematical exposition, not exam preparation or an operating/reference manual; the expert narrative exception applies.','The formal constructions support high integrity and Conway has direct research authority.|Games, order, surreal numbers and algebra connect through one construction; abstraction transfers well, but social and industrial applications are indirect.|Compact technical development earns its length; the mathematical structure is durable.|The playful development is coherent and exact despite demanding notation.',{evidence:['https://www.cut-the-knot.org/books/ONAG/preface.shtml','https://www.routledge.com/On-Numbers-and-Games/Conway/p/book/9780429062438']});
rec(622,2000,[15,6,7,6,8,8,1,5,3,2],0,0,'The substantial autobiographical account and reflective discussion of writing make this a mixed literary memoir with practical advice, not chiefly procedural instruction under the revised rule.','King has firsthand authority on his practice; personal recollection cannot establish universal laws of writing.|Reading, revision and working habits yield transferable craft lessons, but systems integration and the requested technical domain fit are limited.|The short memoir and focused craft reflections justify most of the length; writing constraints endure.|The narrative is memorable and the prose disciplined.',{yearNote:'The book first appeared in 2000. A 1999 catalog date is not treated as its original publication.'});
rec(626,1989,[14,10,10,8,7,8,3,4,3,1.5],0,-10,'Lynch explains investing through company stories and an argument for informed individual judgment. This broad explanatory finance book is not a narrow trading procedure or system manual.','The practitioner supplies concrete business observations; hindsight, selected winners and limited causal controls reduce integrity.|Business models, valuation, growth expectations and investor behavior connect; screening heuristics transfer, though finance remains central.|Examples carry useful distinctions with some repetition; expectations and price discipline are durable.|Accessible stories accumulate clearly, with more certainty than the evidence always warrants.');
rec(627,1996,[16,15,14,10,8,9,7,5,3,2],0,0,'Intel history and the sustained strategic-inflection argument supply the main explanatory arc. Advice about adaptation is not a procedure for operating a specified system.','Grove provides direct leadership and technical-industry access, with retrospective and self-selection limits.|Technology shifts, suppliers, competition, organization and market position jointly explain adaptation; bottleneck recognition has strong reuse.|Focused cases justify the length and the constraints of technological change remain durable.|A coherent case-driven argument with precise strategic distinctions.');
rec(630,2018,[17,15,12,10,8,9,5,5,3,2],-10,0,'Bertaud develops a sustained economic explanation of cities using professional experience and comparative cases. Its intended operational relevance no longer defeats the explicit expert-exposition exception; it is not a municipal procedure manual.','Professional planning experience and quantitative urban evidence support the argument; model assumptions and city selection still limit inference.|Land markets, transport, labor access, density and planning constraints connect strongly; allocation and network lessons transfer beyond cities.|The long explanatory treatment is largely earned and spatial tradeoffs remain durable.|The argument is cumulative and technically precise.',{themeNote:'Urban form and urban development are central, so T11=-10. Infrastructure and allocation, rather than political campaigning, are the main explanation; T12=0.'});
rec(631,2016,[14,10,10,7,7,7,3,4,3,1.5],0,0,'Research stories and a coherent argument about nonconformity organize the work. Broad advice on supporting ideas is not an excluded procedure or specialist reference.','Organizational research and reported cases are informative, but selective success stories and broad extrapolation constrain inference.|Idea selection, social support, dissent and risk link individual action to institutions; the strategic lessons are useful but not deeply technical.|Readable cases sometimes repeat the thesis; organizational incentives outlast the featured personalities.|Clear narrative progression, with occasional compression of uncertainty.',{yearNote:'Adam Grant’s Originals was first published in 2016; the 2001 catalog collision is another work.'});
rec(634,1982,[17,16,14,11,8,9,7,5,2.5,2],0,0,'Deming gives a sustained argument about quality, management and variation with industrial cases. The fourteen points do not make this an instruction manual for a specific procedure; the revised expert exception admits it.','Industrial experience and statistical reasoning support the account; case-based management claims are less controlled than the probability theory.|Variation, incentives, suppliers, production quality and management responsibility form an integrated system with strong strategic transfer.|Detailed industrial examples earn most of the length; reliability and feedback principles remain durable.|Dense but cumulative exposition with careful distinctions between causes of variation.',{yearNote:'Original work published in 1982 as Quality, Productivity, and Competitive Position; Out of the Crisis title dates to 1986. Age is counted from 1982.'});
rec(636,2023,[12,11.333333333333334,9,7.764705882352941,5,6,2,4,3,1],-10,0,'The mixed medical explanation, case narrative and preventive-health argument now pass the narrower H2 boundary. Reassess and retain the earlier limited attainments rather than treating practical health advice alone as a hard exclusion.','Clinical experience is relevant, but preventive prescriptions often extrapolate beyond direct outcome evidence; the earlier integrity limit remains.|Longevity connects risk factors, prevention and personal behavior; mechanisms are useful but medical rather than the requested industrial or physical systems.|Length and personalized protocol detail lower density; some recommendations depend on changing medical evidence.|Clear narrative presentation, with confidence sometimes exceeding the evidence.',{evidence:['data/glasp_261019/prior.json'],themeNote:'Disease prevention and health are central (T11=-10); no rule-12 topic predominates.'});
rec(638,1993,[18,8,7,10,8,9,7,5,2.5,2],0,0,'The exploratory explanation of p-adic numbers includes motivation, examples and a guided conceptual journey. Its course origins do not establish exam preparation or a procedure/reference purpose under the revised exception.','Established mathematical definitions and proofs support integrity; Gouvêa is a number-theory specialist.|Alternative metrics and number systems connect algebra with analysis; their generalization habits transfer, while practical strategy remains indirect.|The compact conceptual development is dense and mathematically durable.|Friendly exposition gives a coherent progression without sacrificing mathematical precision.',{confidence:'moderate'});
rec(640,1985,[11,10,8,6,6,7,4,2,2.5,1],0,0,'The book advances an extended argument about shifts in business assumptions using examples. A general forecasting lens is not a concrete procedure manual.','The consultant’s cases give illustrative evidence, but predictive validation is weak and the paradigm label is stretched.|Assumptions, competition and technological change connect at a broad level; detecting model failure is transferable but causal detail is limited.|Examples repeat a small framework and forecasts date; attention to changing constraints remains useful.|Clear popular exposition with sweeping terminology.',{confidence:'low',yearNote:'The original work appeared as Discovering the Future: The Business of Paradigms in 1985; the later Paradigms issue does not reset age.'});
rec(642,2018,[17,7,5,7,7,9,1,4,2,2],0,-10,'This is a sustained historical argument about how second-century writers received Pauline language. Scholarly discussion of religion is not itself a derived religious text or religious instruction, and the expert narrative exception removes H2.','Detailed textual comparison and scholarly engagement support the historical inference; interpretive disputes remain.|Reception, language and historical context form a narrow intellectual-history explanation; transferable source criticism is present but domain fit is weak.|Dense specialist discussion earns much of its length and the historical record is durable.|The cumulative textual argument is precise but assumes substantial background.',{periodEnd:200,periodConfidence:'moderate',periodNote:'Central second-century reception is assessed through approximately AD 200; H13 reaches the cap.',themeNote:'Religious intellectual history and interpretation dominate; philosophy/theology receives T12=-10, while no listed T11 theme predominates.'});
rec(643,2007,[12,10,8,7,6,7,3,3,3,1],0,0,'Conley uses a hotel-business narrative to argue for a needs-based account of organizations. This mixed explanation and advice is not a specific operational manual.','Firsthand management experience provides access; adapting Maslow into business success claims has weak independent causal support.|Employee, customer and investor incentives connect moderately; needs-based interpretation gives a limited reusable model.|Personal examples and repeated principles dilute density; basic stakeholder incentives are durable.|Readable cases, but expansive claims reduce conceptual precision.',{yearNote:'Original Peak published in 2007; later editions and the catalog’s 2009 record do not reset age.'});
rec(644,2014,[11,7,7,5,6,7,2,2,2.5,1.5],0,-10,'Reflective essays on judgment, careers and character provide a general philosophical account. They are not a procedural training curriculum merely because they offer advice.','Anecdote and selected quotations support reflection more than empirical inference; authority is that of a reflective practitioner.|Learning, incentives and personal choices yield modest portable heuristics, with limited technical or institutional integration.|Short essays repeat familiar lessons; the underlying judgment problems endure.|Readable reflective prose with limited argumentative depth.',{confidence:'low',themeNote:'Practical philosophy and personal judgment dominate, so T12=-10; no T11 theme predominates.'});
rec(647,2023,[17,12,9,9,7,9,7,5,2.5,2],0,-10,'Rapaport sustains philosophical arguments about computation, programs and knowledge. Course origin and a companion instructor manual no longer override the explanatory expert exception; this is not coding instruction.','Extensive philosophical and computing scholarship supports the distinctions; disputed positions are presented as arguments rather than settled findings.|Computation, mathematics, language, cognition and knowledge connect; conceptual distinctions transfer to scientific modeling.|The extensive discussion is substantial but long; the foundations remain durable.|Systematic, careful prose with some textbook-like density.',{themeNote:'Philosophy of computation is the central object, so T12=-10; computing remains a strong direct fit.'});
rec(650,2016,[15,15,12,10,7,8,7,4,3,1.5],0,0,'Platform economics is explained through a sustained argument and comparative company cases. The owner-manual label does not make its main structure a machine/system procedure or technical lookup reference.','Economic scholarship and company cases support the framework; platform success selection limits generality.|Network effects, governance, pricing, matching and technology connect strongly; design constraints have broad strategic reuse.|Some business examples repeat, but market coordination and network mechanisms endure.|Clear cumulative structure with occasional promotional certainty.');
rec(651,2016,[11,10,9,6,6,6,4,3,3,1],0,0,'The category-design thesis is developed through business cases and a sustained market argument. It passes the revised general explanatory boundary despite its practical recommendations.','Consulting cases are selectively chosen and do not establish the claimed causal primacy of category design.|Market perception, products and organizational focus connect; some positioning heuristics transfer, but mechanisms are coarse.|The branded framework is repetitive and partly fashion-dependent, without evidence that passing publicity is its sole value.|Accessible narrative with exaggerated terminology.',{confidence:'low'});
rec(653,1981,[13,10,9,7,8,8,3,3,3,1.5],0,-10,'Positioning is an extended argument about perception and competitive communication, illustrated by campaigns. It is not a script book or procedural advertising reference.','Campaign experience gives concrete observations, but selected cases support weaker causal claims than the law-like rhetoric suggests.|Attention limits, category associations and competition connect; framing heuristics transfer beyond advertising.|The concise core argument is dense and persists beyond specific brands.|Clear memorable distinctions, sometimes overstated.',{yearNote:'The book first appeared in 1981; later editions including 2000 do not reset original age.',themeNote:'Advertising and media communication are central, so T12=-10.'});
rec(655,2018,[14,12,11,8,8,8,4,4,3,1.5],0,0,'McCord develops a coherent account of organizational culture through Netflix experience. General hiring and management judgments are not a narrow procedural or reference book.','Direct executive experience supports the account, with selection and survivorship bias.|Talent, candor, incentives and organizational change connect; the constraints of high-autonomy work have reusable lessons.|Concise experience-based chapters earn their length; employment tradeoffs endure.|Direct and clear, with limited evidence for universal application.');
rec(658,2015,[13,11,10,8,6,7,4,3,3,1.5],0,0,'The motivation model is argued through organizational evidence and case narratives. A proposed measurement tool is an application, not sufficient reason for H2.','Research synthesis and consulting observations provide support, but the Total Motivation metric is not equivalent to causal proof.|Motives, incentives, culture and performance connect; experimental management questions transfer more strongly than the branded metric.|Length and repeated framework exposition reduce density; motivation problems remain durable.|Coherent accessible structure, with claims stronger than demonstrated validation.');
rec(661,2017,[13,12,10,8,5,8,4,4,2.5,1.5],0,-10,'The autobiographical arc and sustained discussion of decision principles provide a general reflective argument. Numbered advice is not by itself an excluded operational procedure.','Dalio’s direct organizational experience is substantial; self-selection and founder retrospective bias limit causal confidence.|Feedback, incentives, decision rules and organizational authority connect; reusable ideas coexist with a highly specific culture.|A long rule inventory and repetition lower density, while error correction and incentives endure.|Orderly but overextended exposition; conceptual control is uneven.',{themeNote:'Decision philosophy and organizational authority dominate the life/work principles, so T12=-10; no T11 theme predominates.'});
rec(665,2003,[18,14,14,12,8,9,7,5,3,2],0,0,'Jaynes’s sustained argument for probability as extended logic is narrative expert exposition. Formal applications and course adoption do not make the work an exam guide, procedure manual or primarily lookup reference.','Explicit derivations and foundational criticism support high integrity; the strongly Bayesian stance and contested philosophical claims prevent full attainment.|Logic, probability, statistical mechanics and scientific inference connect tightly; reasoning under incomplete information has exceptional reuse.|Dense development largely earns the substantial length and foundational questions endure.|Cumulative, argumentative and precise, though polemical in places.',{evidence:['https://www.cambridge.org/core/books/probability-theory/9CA08E224FF30123304E6D8935CF1A99','https://assets.cambridge.org/97805215/92710/frontmatter/9780521592710_frontmatter.pdf']});
rec(680,2016,[15,12,11,9,8,8,4,4,3,1.5],0,-10,'Company case studies develop a sustained argument about business quality and long-term ownership. This is explanatory investment analysis rather than a narrow trading or accounting procedure manual.','Practitioner analysis uses identifiable businesses; survivor selection and retrospective classification limit inference.|Competitive position, capital returns, incentives and durability connect; business-quality heuristics transfer to industrial assessment.|Focused cases earn much of the length and structural advantages endure.|Clear analytical organization with some simplified success explanations.');
rec(687,2017,[13,10,10,7,6,8,3,3,3,1.5],0,0,'Managerial cases support a coherent account of feedback and personal care. Broad interpersonal advice does not satisfy the narrower procedural hard exclusion.','Management experience supplies examples, but the two-axis framework has limited independent causal validation.|Feedback, trust, hierarchy and performance connect; communication heuristics transfer, with modest mechanism depth.|Repeated situations dilute density; feedback and incentive conflicts remain durable.|Readable cases and clear categories, sometimes too binary.');
rec(688,1997,[15,8,8,7,7,8,1,4,3,1.5],0,0,'The empirical account of children’s emotion and parental interaction sustains a general explanatory argument. Its five-step advice does not amount to a specific clinical procedure manual.','Research-informed parenting observations support the account, though intervention claims need limits and families differ.|Emotion, communication and family feedback form a narrow social system; listening and conflict lessons transfer modestly.|Case-based explanation is reasonably focused and interpersonal constraints endure.|Clear and practical, with some simplification of developmental uncertainty.',{themeNote:'Parenting is weak profile fit but is not one of the specified T11 or T12 deductions.'});
rec(690,1984,[18,13,11,12,9,9,7,5,3,2],0,0,'The book follows a sustained conceptual bridge between random walks and electrical networks with intuitive explanations. The former specialist-method exclusion gives way to the explicit expert narrative exception.','Mathematical arguments and explicit correspondences support integrity; the authors have direct disciplinary standing.|Probability, potential theory and resistor networks connect tightly; analogy and dual representation have broad modeling reuse.|Compact exposition gives high density and enduring mathematical mechanisms.|The explanatory route is coherent and precise.',{evidence:['https://math.dartmouth.edu/~doyle/docs/walks/walks.pdf','https://arxiv.org/html/math/0001057v1']});
rec(692,2008,[17,13,13,10,9,9,6,5,3,2],0,-10,'Binmore’s critique of the range of Bayesian decision theory is a sustained, relatively nontechnical expert argument. It is not chiefly instructions for using a specialist technique.','The work distinguishes axioms and scope carefully; its proposed extension remains a theoretical argument, not an empirical guarantee.|Risk, beliefs, preferences and strategic interaction connect; small-world versus large-world limits have strong transferable use.|Concise foundations and counterexamples earn the length and endure.|Precise cumulative argument with limited mathematical overhead.',{yearNote:'Publisher records date first release to 2008, although copyright and many library citations use 2009; original production year 2008 is retained at moderate confidence.',evidence:['https://www.degruyterbrill.com/document/doi/10.1515/9781400833092/html'],themeNote:'Normative decision theory and philosophy of rational choice are central (T12=-10).'});
rec(695,2021,[16,12,12,9,8,8,5,4,3,2],0,0,'Pinker gives a sustained public explanation of reasoning and its limits. Teaching general reasoning concepts no longer establishes H2 in the absence of exam preparation or concrete procedural instruction.','The synthesis explains formal tools and cognitive findings; broad social extrapolation receives a discount.|Logic, probability, utility, games and causal inference connect; calibrated reasoning and model limits are transferable.|The broad tour is dense for general readers but basic for this reader; the concepts endure.|Clear cumulative exposition and controlled prose.',{themeNote:'Reasoning, quantification and causal inference are central; political examples do not make politics predominant.'});
rec(696,2010,[18,12,12,10,8,9,5,5,2.5,2],0,0,'Stanovich advances a sustained research argument about rationality and cognitive architecture. Specialist audience alone no longer establishes H2.','The account draws on sustained cognitive research and distinguishes ability from reflective disposition; theoretical interpretation remains contestable.|Intelligence, reflective control, beliefs and rationality connect; the distinction between capacity and willingness to reason is reusable.|Dense scholarly exposition earns its length and core distinctions are durable.|Systematic and precise, though technically demanding.',{yearNote:'Oxford reports first publication on 3 December 2010; the copyright page says 2011. Use the earlier documented production date.',evidence:['https://academic.oup.com/book/5930?searchresult=1','https://academic.oup.com/book/5930/chapter-abstract/149249722']});
rec(701,2005,[13,11,8,7,6,8,3,5,2,1.5],0,-10,'Latour’s account is a sustained theoretical argument about social explanation. Methodological implications do not make it a procedure manual under the narrower rule.','The conceptual criticism and empirical examples are substantive; broad causal claims and terminology need careful limits.|Actors, artifacts and institutions are linked, but the framework often describes associations more than it specifies testable mechanisms.|Length and repeated conceptual redefinition lower density; questions of distributed agency remain durable.|Original but demanding prose, with some unstable abstractions.',{themeNote:'Social theory and philosophy of explanation are central, so T12=-10.'});
rec(707,2010,[18,9,6,8,7,9,3,5,2.5,2],0,-10,'The chronology of a formal idea across Arabic logical traditions is a sustained historical explanation. Its expert readership and technical detail no longer defeat the narrative exception.','Manuscript-based scholarship and careful reconstruction support integrity; transmission claims remain interpretation-dependent.|Logic, education and intellectual transmission connect; source criticism and conceptual continuity offer modest transfer.|Specialist detail is substantial but mostly necessary; the historical account is durable.|Careful chronological argument with precise scholarly prose.',{periodEnd:1900,periodConfidence:'high',periodNote:'The central history explicitly runs from 900 to 1900.',themeNote:'History of logic and philosophy is central, so T12=-10.',evidence:['https://books.google.com/books/about/Relational_Syllogisms_and_the_History_of.html?id=VuB5DwAAQBAJ']});
rec(710,2013,[14,11,10,8,8,8,4,4,3,1.5],0,0,'Remote is a sustained argument for distributed work illustrated by company experience. General organizational recommendations are not operation of a specific technical system.','The authors have direct remote-company experience; selective success cases limit universal claims.|Location, communication, hiring and coordination costs connect; organizational tradeoffs transfer beyond software.|Concise chapters focus the argument and coordination issues remain durable.|Clear and concrete, with a deliberately one-sided persuasive emphasis.');
rec(713,2010,[13,11,10,7,8,8,4,4,3,1.5],0,0,'Short experience-based essays collectively argue for a different way to build companies. This is broad business reasoning, not a procedural curriculum or technical reference.','Practitioner cases offer insight but limited controlled evidence; the authors’ successful niche may not generalize.|Constraints, staffing, product scope and incentives connect; simplifying commitments has useful strategic transfer.|Brief chapters are dense, though assertions are not deeply defended; the tradeoffs endure.|Direct memorable prose, with categorical advice that needs context.');
rec(723,1997,[17,8,7,7,7,9,2,4,2.5,2],0,-10,'McGinn offers a sustained interpretation of Wittgenstein’s argument. This scholarly explanatory reading is not an exam guide or specialist procedure manual.','Close reading and philosophical scholarship support interpretation; alternative readings remain possible.|Language, rule-following and meaning connect conceptually; the methodological payload transfers modestly to modeling.|Detailed commentary is demanding but durable, with a narrow profile fit.|Careful cumulative interpretation and precise prose.',{yearNote:'First published in 1997 as Wittgenstein and the Philosophical Investigations; later Routledge Guidebook branding does not reset age.',themeNote:'Philosophy is central (T12=-10).'});
rec(726,1995,[18,16,14,12,8,9,7,5,2.5,2],0,0,'Leveson combines extensive accident histories with a sustained argument about system safety and causation. The expert narrative exception admits this explanatory core despite textbook use.','Accident evidence and safety-engineering scholarship support strong integrity; causal reconstruction still depends on available investigations.|Software, hardware, organization, human behavior and regulation interact; constraints and failure mechanisms transfer broadly.|The long treatment contains reference-like portions but much is earned by case analysis; safety principles endure.|Systematic, exact exposition, though technically dense.');
