rec(839,2001,[8,7,5,4,5,7,1,2,2.5,1],0,-10,'Greene develops a broad account of seductive influence through historical and literary cases. The work is not a narrow professional or machine procedure manual, so the former broad advice exclusion is removed. Its weak causal support and instrumental view of people reduce scores; those flaws alone do not establish explicit hate or political ideology.','Selected anecdotes and literature cannot establish the claimed general laws; authority is that of a popular synthesizer, not a validated social researcher.|Desire, attention, status and influence connect, but mechanisms are under-tested and the requested industrial or scientific fit is weak.|The long taxonomy repeats its thesis; social-influence questions endure beyond the examples.|The cases are readable but theatrical certainty and loose categories reduce precision.',{confidence:'low',evidence:['https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/286423/the-art-of-seduction-by-robert-greene/9780142001196/'],yearNote:'The original hardcover appeared in 2001; the publisher’s current paperback record is 2003, not a new original work.'});
rec(841,2011,[12,8,9,6,8,8,4,2,3,1.5],0,0,'The short essay chapters explain recurring reasoning errors through examples. This general-reader explanatory collection is not a specialist reference or a prescribed technical procedure, so the revised rule admits it despite limited cumulative architecture.','The author synthesizes real cognitive research but compresses uncertainty and does not independently establish the mechanisms; scholarly authority is limited.|Biases, incentives and everyday decisions connect moderately; diagnostic heuristics transfer, though the industrial and scientific links remain indirect.|Short chapters are efficient, with uneven selection; common inference errors are durable topics.|Accessible examples aid recall, but compressed summaries can obscure qualifications.',{confidence:'moderate',yearNote:'The German original Die Kunst des klaren Denkens appeared in 2011; English translation in 2013 does not reset original age.',evidence:['https://www.dobelli.com/en/books/','https://www.hachette.co.uk/titles/rolf-dobelli/the-art-of-thinking-clearly/9781444759556/']});
rec(1053,1994,[10,9,8,5,6,7,3,3,2.5,1],0,0,'Peters’s columns, company stories and responses form a broad argumentative essay collection about business change. They are not a specific operating procedure or specialist reference. Fragmented structure lowers narrative and density scores rather than triggering the former broad practical-advice exclusion.','Management observations have practitioner access but selected success cases and the wow slogan offer weak causal tests.|Customer attention, organizational behavior and adaptation provide some reusable ideas; mechanisms are coarse and technical detail limited.|More than two hundred elements create repetition and a fragmented structure; some organizational lessons outlast the period’s business rhetoric.|Energetic columns are easy to read but slogan-heavy and weakly cumulative.',{yearConfidence:'high',yearNote:'Publisher records original paperback on 22 November 1994.',evidence:['https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/130185/the-pursuit-of-wow-by-tom-peters/']});
rec(1061,1959,[18,10,7,10,8,9,7,5,2,2],0,0,'Clagett’s account follows medieval statics, kinematics and dynamics through their development and later fate. The edited source material supports a sustained history of ideas; it no longer warrants blanket exclusion as an expert reference under the narrative exception.','Detailed source editions, textual analysis and specialist historical scholarship support high integrity, with disputes about retrospective interpretation possible.|Mathematical arguments, physical concepts and transmission across intellectual traditions connect; transfer lies chiefly in tracing model development rather than practical strategy.|The long source-rich treatment earns much of its length and remains durable historical scholarship.|The four-part historical development is cumulative but technically demanding; definitions and source distinctions are precise.',{periodEnd:1600,periodConfidence:'moderate',periodNote:'The central medieval mechanics account extends to its early-modern fate; circa 1600 is the assessed upper endpoint. H13 is capped at -12 in either the fifteenth- or sixteenth-century interpretation.',yearConfidence:'high',yearNote:'Original University of Wisconsin Press edition is 1959; 1961 is a later issue.',evidence:['https://books.google.com/books?id=CAsnAAAAMAAJ','https://catalog.folger.edu/record/87887']});
rec(1093,2017,[12,9,10,6,8,8,3,3,2,1.5],0,-10,'Clark’s commentary on Munger’s remarks supplies a broad explanation of investing and judgment. The book is a reflective general-reader collection, not a professional method reference merely because it contains advice; fragmented structure is reflected in N.','The quotations preserve practitioner ideas but selection and the interpreter’s causal claims require caution; investment success is not proof of each maxim.|Incentives, uncertainty, business quality and judgment yield useful transferable heuristics, but finance remains the central application.|The compact commentary is reasonably dense; repeated principles remain useful despite limited independent evidence.|Individual explanations are clear but the quote-by-quote structure is less cumulative than a sustained monograph.',{yearConfidence:'high',yearNote:'Publisher gives 3 January 2017 for the original book.',evidence:['https://www.simonandschuster.com/books/Tao-of-Charlie-Munger/David-Clark/9781501153358'],themeNote:'Investing and finance are central, so T12=-10; neither biography nor other T11 themes predominate.'});

